I don't agree here. The precise details of price-IDing are difficult to
find out, that's true, but the fact that high level things are expensive
and low level stuff is cheap can be guessed.

The exact way in which cursing works is more difficult to find out. Before
I read the spoilers, I always assumed that every item you're carrying had
a flat chance of being cursed. It's not easy to find out that it actually
works in another way, and had my assumption been right, it wouldn't have
made any sense to carry lots of cursecatchers in my inventory.

Also, shops are encountered by beginning characters and advanced players
alike, while only experienced players will get hit by curses, so you'll be
much more likely to find out about price-IDing than how exactly cursing
works...

